commit 2e53ca194dfbfbeeab7dd6389fc0d0c7733d5b5f
Author: root <root@LAPTOP-FVNNQNU9.localdomain>
Date:   Wed Sep 9 21:38:32 2026 +0800

    cpu: rv64: allow f16 dst for brgemm inner product
    
    Relax the dst_dt==f32 gate of rvv_brgemm_inner_product_fwd_t to accept a
    f16 dst when Zvfh is available, and narrow the f32 accumulators to f16
    (vfncvt.f.f.w) on the brgemm f16 kernel C store (both the 4-column path
    and the single-column tail, including the beta-accumulate form).
    Resolves the ref_inner_product_fwd_t fallback for f16:f16:f16 inner
    product, whose scalar off_v/recompute + software f16->f32 conversion
    dominated the hotspot.

